The '''Turtle Pet''' is a {{Skl|Combat}} [[Pet]] that can be obtained from the [[Dark Auction]]. Like all pets from the Dark Auction, the Turtle Pet only comes in two rarities: {{Epic}} and {{Legendary}}.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Turtle Pet''' has a chance to appear in round 1, 3 or 4 of the [[Dark Auction]]. The {{Epic}} has an overall {{Green|22.706%}} chance to appear, and the {{Legendary}} has a {{Green|6.05%}} chance to appear.

